{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:47 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:47 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:47 2026-11-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"沙田碩門邨男子單位內暈倒  家人發現惜太遲。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c025f4c88783208cb0aaeeece247b8b0/2026-11/1151745.jpg\"/><p>沙田發生屍體發現案。周六（14日）晚上9時17分，一名姓農（44歲）男子在沙田碩門邨豐碩樓一個單位內暈倒，其家人發現後報警。警員接報到場，發現男子已當場死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，死者為的士司機。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:15:52.852595+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T21:47:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:56.398826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:56.398826+00:00","content_hash":"6aca327e903463dfd2a3594297b8c49df51d282e789e6445923fcd6b053f0f9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}